Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:42.46,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,What nice weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:46.40,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Kacchan should be running\Nin the park right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:58.52,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Morning, Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:02:59.92,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Going out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.60,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I'm going to\Nclean the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:08.94,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Waking up early and cleaning,\Njust like your dear departed mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:11.00,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,What a great daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:15.40,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:18.92,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,All right.\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.50,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Just like Tacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.10,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\pos(484,673)}Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:50.94,Deafault,Man:,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.34,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Done with the morning chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:04.48,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Kacchan's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:05.90,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,{\pos(481,665)}Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:06.54,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:07.47,Karaoke Translation op,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx95\fscy81.25\3c&H3B3779&\frz39.013\pos(210,197)}South Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.18,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Here, a present for you\Nthis morning, Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.94,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,From the Mom & Pop\Nvegetable store?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.08,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:17.00,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,...whenever he sees me,\Nhe just talks about the Koushien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.04,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:19.34,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,He can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.80,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,You're everyone's star of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.48,Deafault,Tazuya:,0,0,0,,Out of everyone, you're the\None that expects the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.00,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:31.46,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,You promised me you'd\Ntake me to the Koushien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.34,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NI'll definitely take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:35.50,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.60,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,I gotcha. I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:40.60,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,I'll take you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:43.14,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Hey, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.24,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,...up this early\Nin the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:47.32,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,You two look good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:48.90,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.72,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Don't say such weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.60,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,See ya.  I've got\Nmorning practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.68,Deafault,Father???:,0,0,0,,A distinct head\Nand perfect grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:57.82,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,He's the sportsman\Nof future generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.94,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,We're counting on you,\Nnext door neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:04.08,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,I won't have to worry\Nwhen you're his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.42,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Oh, such bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:13.20,Karaoke Translation op,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\frx28\fry330\3c&H3B3779&\fscx188\fscy150\frz14.75\move(468,269,490.667,233,15,5938)}South Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:09.34,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Hurry!  Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:11.48,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I have to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:13.08,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Right, right, right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.50,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Kacchan, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:23.62,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:27.02,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,It's pretty early.\NWhy don't you take your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.38,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Nope, I want to\Nwatch baseball practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:35.46,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,That Tacchan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.97,0:05:38.35,Karaoke Translation op,text:,114,398,123,,{\a6\frz13.927\fscx135\fscy107.5\pos(221,82)}{\c&H000000&\3c&HDBDAA5&}Science
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.97,0:05:38.35,Karaoke Translation op,text:,350,48,361,,{\a6\frz16.557\fscx110\fscy78\pos(529,556)}{\c&H000000&\3c&HDBDAA5&}Uesugi Tatsuya
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:41.60,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,English, Math,\NJapanese, Science.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:47.82,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,That does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.28,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:58.26,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Hey!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:58.92,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.70,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Did Kazuya go to school yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.75,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,He should've!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.48,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Is Tatsuya still sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.38,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,He couldn't be sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:08.40,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,He's always doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:16.55,Karaoke Translation op,text:,14,298,332,,{\a5\fscx75\fscy62.5\pos(122,540)}{\c&H66CED0&\3c&H000000&}Meisei Junior High School
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.52,Deafault,Girls:,0,0,0,,Kazuya, you're wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:31.56,Deafault,Girls:,0,0,0,,So cool!\NKeep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.76,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Good! Good!\NGreat as usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:40.90,Deafault,Girl2,0,0,0,,Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.90,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,All right, Kazuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.05,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Put 'er right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:54.80,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.70,Deafault,Girls:,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.05,Karaoke Translation op,text:,250,133,261,,{\a6\frz2.215\fscx87.5\fscy82.5\pos(430,249)}{\c&H000000&\3c&HDBDAA5&}Junior High Math
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.54,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Huh?\NMinami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.95,Karaoke Translation op,text???:,421,5,245,,{\a5\fscx151.25\fscy118.75\pos(401,106)\frz22.51}{\c&HFFFFFF&}Baseball\NClub
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.87,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Kazuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:28.10,Deafault,Girl2:,0,0,0,,Have a good game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.45,Deafault,Girl3:,0,0,0,,We'll be cheering you on.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:30.75,Deafault,Girl4:,0,0,0,,How's your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:37.72,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Kacchan, it's hard\Nbeing popular, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.40,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,It's troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.75,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:45.54,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,You didn't break\Nyour tardy record!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.54,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:50.70,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.22,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Even in your shoe box.\NWhat a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.90,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I'll pick them up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:05.01,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Here, loverboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:08.30,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,What about you, Tacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.00,Karaoke Translation op,text:,0,0,0,,{\a6\frz21.427\fscx116.25\fscy87.5\pos(353,72)}{\c&H000000&\3c&HE4E3D2&}Declaration\Nof Revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.00,Deafault,text:,0,0,0,,Declaration of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:21.12,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.50,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,That's right!\NThat's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:30.10,Deafault,Teach:,0,0,0,,Draw a line between two\Nangles and call it AB.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:34.00,Deafault,Teach:,0,0,0,,Call the diagonal C.\NSo the following theorem holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:37.32,Deafault,Teach:,0,0,0,,A squared plus\NB squared = C squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:43.45,Karaoke Translation op,text:,121,290,177,,{\a6\fscx80\fscy86.25\pos(258,170)\frz14.61}{\c&H000000&\3c&HDEDEE5&}Mr. Uesugi Kazuya
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.12,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,It's from Takizawa Youko\Nin class 2B, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.45,Deafault,Tat:,0,0,0,,A cute girl\Nwith pretty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.52,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:48.08,Deafault,Tat:,0,0,0,,Ol' Tacchan will\Ntake care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:56.40,Karaoke Translation op,text:,178,212,256,,{\a6\frz10.572\fscx127.5\fscy95\pos(437,194)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5C240F&}Boys' Bathroom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.08,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.72,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Just like a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I look just like Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.10,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Uesugi, you came\Nfor me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:23.94,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.92,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,No way!\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.36,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.94,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:33.75,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Don't you have\Nbaseball practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:34.64,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:37.64,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,It's not necessary\Nfor me to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:41.38,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,That's right.\NYou're a genius, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:45.10,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,When you get to high school,\Nwill you play in the Koushien?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.56,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.52,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I'm not too\Nsure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.96,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Rather than that,\NI'm living life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.87,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,You're pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.72,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Oh, my.\NWhat should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:04.62,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Tacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.45,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:09.36,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Tacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.30,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.48,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Huh?\NTacchan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:14.56,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.90,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,It's okay! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.00,Deafault,Girl:,0,0,0,,Tacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.80,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Where did I goof up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:29.00,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,No matter how you look,\NI'll still know it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.14,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:34.42,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I thought\NI looked like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:39.70,Deafault,minami:,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.48,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Hey!\NWhat're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.06,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,{\pos(477,676)}Tacchan is Tacchan!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.90,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Kacchan is Kacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.82,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Why're you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:55.42,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,You know Kazuya doesn't want\Nto see any girl other than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.06,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,It's fine if you\Nleave me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.60,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.98,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What's with...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.44,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Minami, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:25.68,Karaoke Translation op,text:,278,248,268,,{\a6\c&H000000&\3c&HE8DFDB&\pos(458,265)}{\c&H000000&\3c&HA6A37A&}Uesugi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.75,Deafault,TV:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}Those sweet memories of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:35.16,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Oh, Honey, we still\Nhave memories of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:41.75,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Gotcha! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.28,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,I'll clean this ear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:54.77,Deafault,Mother:,0,0,0,,Oh, Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.50,Deafault,Mother:,0,0,0,,All finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.88,Deafault,Mother:,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.66,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Tatsuya, are you just\Ngonna watch television?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:11.30,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be studying with\NKazuya and Minami in the study room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.40,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:13.52,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.77,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:46.80,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Honey, hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:51.77,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}Our family, the Uesugi's, and the\Nfamily next door, the Asakura's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:56.86,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}...had three kids born\Nin the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.28,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}We've always been friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:04.14,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}And very active.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:07.26,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,I still think they're\Nrestless, even for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.32,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:13.75,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}One day, our parents\Nwith their hands full...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:16.22,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,All right, we'll put\Nour powers together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:18.48,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Let's put the\Nkids together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.98,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:22.21,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}In between both houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.80,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}...they pitched in and\Nmade a house for us kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:31.38,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Quiet, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.00,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Yes, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.70,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.16,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}At first, it was just\Na place for us to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:44.01,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}A few years later, its name\Nchanged to the "study room."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:49.75,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}Then we noticed that one of\Nthe three of us was a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:52.86,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF80&}It was at\Nabout that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:36.07,Karaoke Translation op,text:,14,298,332,,{\a5\fscx72.5\fscy76.25\pos(125,538)}{\c&H66CED0&\3c&H000000&}Meisei Junior High School
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.72,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:45.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Lucky guy, being surrounded\Nby girls so early in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:48.81,Deafault,Boy:,0,0,0,,Hey, Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:50.66,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,We've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:53.90,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,We got a good book!\NWanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.88,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Why do I gotta be\Nsurrounded by guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:00.09,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.\NCalm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.30,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Uesugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:12.55,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:16.21,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What a cute cushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.29,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Will you do it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:21.61,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What?\NGive it to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.29,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Yes.\NTo Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:25.19,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,It's a handmade cushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:26.35,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:30.67,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Now see here! \NGive it to him directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:31.93,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:35.59,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,It'd be bad if other\Ngirls found out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:38.73,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,When you go home,\Ncan you give it to Kazuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:39.79,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:41.75,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,There's no point...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:43.40,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...no matter how much\Nyou like Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:45.10,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.97,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Kazuya's got Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.30,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.13,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.93,Deafault,Yasuko:,0,0,0,,Asakura said she was only\NKazuya's childhood friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:58.85,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,They're childhood friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:02.29,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...but not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:21.95,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Tacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:23.30,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I...uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.50,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,How're you gonna\Nmake up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.30,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Huh? About w...what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.13,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Don't "about what" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:36.35,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,What did you tell Yasuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.99,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Yasuko...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.37,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Oh, Yasuko with the\Nhandmade cushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:42.21,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Don't "Oh!" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:47.19,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,The girls are in an uproar because\Nof your irresponsible words!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:50.09,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Why're they in an uproar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:53.70,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,When did Kacchan and\NI say we were engaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:56.70,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:01.67,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,That's right, though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:05.29,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,It's a fact that that's what both of our parents want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.99,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,That has nothing\Nto do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:10.33,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,All real people\Ndecide for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:13.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,You don't like Kazuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.69,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,It's not that\NI don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.51,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Hey, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:20.49,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...for the two of you,\Nand for everyone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:23.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...shouldn't you let it\Nhappen out in the open?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:24.95,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:29.13,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,We haven't even planned\Na wedding or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.30,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,There's no telling\Nwhat could happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:35.97,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of\Nnice person Kacchan might meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:39.57,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,There's no telling what type\Nof person I might start liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.87,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,But if I go wrong somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:46.00,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,...I could wind up getting\Nmarried to a weirdo like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:18:00.20,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Just...for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.53,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.83,Deafault,Boy:,0,0,0,,You jerk!\NGimme back my book!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:07.35,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Okay, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:09.26,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Go explain it clearly to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:11.15,Deafault,Boy:,0,0,0,,You're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:12.17,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Cute as usual, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.15,Deafault,Boy:,0,0,0,,{\pos(520,656)}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.15,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,{\a6\pos(516,664)}{\c&HFFFE8F&}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.81,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,If you mean the book,\Nit fell down on school grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:16.19,Deafault,Boy&Fasto:,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:21.88,Deafault,Flat:,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:25.55,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,Harada has it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:44.83,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.88,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Big Brother, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:53.57,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:56.00,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:03.91,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!\NOw, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:08.69,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,You're not in shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.75,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,When we get to high school,\Nyou should join a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:16.41,Deafault,Koutarou:,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:17.95,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,I'm in great shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:21.11,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Yeah!\NAwesome, awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:31.25,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Say, Kacchan,\Nwhat's this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.73,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Let's see. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.05,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.83,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,I'm disturbing your studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.10,Deafault,Kazuya:,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:15.56,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,What about this\Nwedding dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:16.57,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Look.\NThis is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.67,Deafault,Dad:,0,0,0,,Where? Oh, Minami \Nwould look great in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.09,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:26.65,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,But Kacchan's bridegroom\Nfigure is really fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.65,0:20:31.30,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,Those two are\Nthe ideal couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:32.90,Deafault,Father:,0,0,0,,I'm looking\Nforward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:37.47,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Look.\NThis one's wonderful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.11,0:20:44.33,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,But if I go\Nwrong somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:48.30,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,...I could wind up getting\Nmarried to a weirdo like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:53.61,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Just...for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:07.13,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,For example, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:25.65,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Mom!  Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:27.30,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Where did my bag\Nthat was here go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:29.21,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I had it right by the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:31.55,Deafault,Mother:,0,0,0,,What're you fussing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.55,0:21:32.73,Deafault,Mother:,0,0,0,,Isn't it Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:33.99,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I've got practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.02,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Hurry and find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.35,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:37.39,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:38.39,Deafault,katsuya:,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:39.75,Deafault,katsuya:,0,0,0,,Well, gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:40.67,Deafault,Mom:,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:27.00,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,What're you doing\Nsleeping in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:29.99,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.99,0:22:33.23,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,My parents are\Nwhining about...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:36.50,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...how Kazuya is always doing\Nhis homework so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:40.25,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,You saw, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:42.77,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nstarted to get undressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.51,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:46.83,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.83,0:22:50.07,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,A real pervert wouldn't have\Ncoughed out loud until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:56.65,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.95,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,Shit!\NSo close!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.09,0:23:01.70,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Tacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:05.35,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.35,0:23:06.73,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,Wanna go to the pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:09.40,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I bought a new swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:13.70,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,What am I,\NKazuya's pinch-hitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:17.20,Deafault,Minami:,0,0,0,,I won't force you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.77,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.67,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,It's a pain.\NBut, oh well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:23.20,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,...I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:31.67,Deafault,Tatsuya:,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have coughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:38.02,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Hey, Minami...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:40.60,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,...at the pool some beautiful\Ngirl just starts talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:42.88,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, she's taken\Nan interest in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:46.44,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,She asked if I wanted to play\Nbaseball and told me I have talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:47.88,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Popular guys have\Na hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.34,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Tacchan, at least do the\Npreviews seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:51.36,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:52.60,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Next time on Touch...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:55.20,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,"A Woman's Intuition.\NTatsuya's Talent is on my mind."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:57.15,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,It'll be interesting,\Nso watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.15,0:23:58.15,Deafault,Trailer:,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.05,0:24:17.16,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,331,,{\a6\pos(473,646)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}How many summers have now passed by between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:23.76,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,331,,{\a6\pos(473,641)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}Without you, even a picture of the beach I took...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.76,0:24:26.06,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(465,646)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}...when we were romping around...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:34.21,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(478,646)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}...looks so monochromatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.21,0:24:42.06,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(489,649)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}A thing that time has left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:51.58,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(489,650)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}Listen, I get speechless every time I see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:25:02.15,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(485,644)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}...for I only want to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:15.00,Karaoke Translation op,esong:,0,0,359,,{\a6\pos(486,645)}{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}Please stay here forever.
